   $q$The coach calls Tobias and Priya "friendly enemies." What does this phrase show about their relationship?$q$, $q$[{"text":"They have only just met and do not yet know each other well.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"They refuse to play against each other in real tournaments.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"They secretly dislike each other but pretend to get along.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-tone"},{"text":"They are close friends who also compete hard against each other.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$They are close friends who also compete hard against each other.$q$, $q$The next sentence explains the label: they eat lunch together every day, yet each keeps "a notebook of the other's favorite openings." Nothing suggests hidden dislike; the ending calls their bond a real "friendship."$q$, 'draft', '248dda41-945b-504d-807d-6115bfb9063e')
