values
  ('2d38b964-39f6-5f82-a02e-5bdca40c74a9', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g10-figurative-language'), null, 'hard',
   $q$Ifeoma writes "a very educational evening" at the top of her cue sheet and keeps it after opening night. How does this detail develop the meaning of the phrase?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It shows that she disagreed with the director and wanted to remember her complaint.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It turns the joke into a sincere truth, since the hard rehearsal helped make opening night succeed.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It suggests that she forgot her cues and needed the note to remember them.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"It proves that the director's phrase was meant as a harsh insult to the crew.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-tone"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It turns the joke into a sincere truth, since the hard rehearsal helped make opening night succeed.$q$, $q$Her cues "landed exactly on time," and she keeps the sheet "as a reminder of how they got there," so the euphemism becomes literally true. Nothing suggests she disagreed with the director; she adopts his phrase.$q$, 'draft', '621ead57-d96b-532a-8dc5-8ef6ef0fc115')
