   $q$How does the fourth paragraph refine the central idea of the passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It repeats the claim that listening is better than every other method of counting birds.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"It shifts the passage's focus from bird migration to the problem of noise in growing towns.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-structure"},{"text":"It suggests that the Harrowgate recordings were mostly useless because of rain and traffic noise.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overstates-limits"},{"text":"It qualifies the idea by showing that sound is one useful tool to be combined with others, not a complete count.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It qualifies the idea by showing that sound is one useful tool to be combined with others, not a complete count.$q$, $q$The paragraph lists what calls cannot show and says the team compares recordings "with radar images and morning counts rather than relying on sound alone." The final paragraph's "Still" shows the method remains valuable, so the limits do not make it useless.$q$, 'draft', 'd7e45505-307c-5593-ba89-29005b3e5902')
