   $q$Which statement best expresses the central idea of the passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Hospitals should give every wing a color, because colors are easier to remember than numbers.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"Calder General needed a new building because its old hallways were too confusing to fix.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"By studying where visitors got confused and redesigning the information they received, Calder General became much easier to navigate.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Nurses and technicians at large hospitals spend most of their time giving directions.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overgeneralization"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$By studying where visitors got confused and redesigning the information they received, Calder General became much easier to navigate.$q$, $q$The passage moves from the problem to the team's observations, its connected changes and the improved survey results. The final paragraph says the hospital "did not need a new building," which rules out the second choice.$q$, 'draft', '2123051e-13ae-5606-908b-acb521fc62b7')
