   $q$When Ms. Achebe says, "Look more carefully at how," what does she most likely want?$q$, $q$[{"text":"She thinks Priya was wrong that Tobias went back to the readings.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"She wants Priya to rescan the October pages because they are blurry.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"She wants Priya to stop working and read the family letters instead.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"},{"text":"She wants Priya to discover the change in Tobias's method on her own.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$She wants Priya to discover the change in Tobias's method on her own.$q$, $q$She first agrees ("He did"), then points Priya toward how he did it, and Priya then finds the half degrees and the note "Hester's method." Because she agrees with Priya, she is not saying Priya was wrong.$q$, 'draft', '159dae90-fd07-5b66-9a26-5393df1ab587')
