   $q$According to the passage, what is the goal of the contest?$q$, $q$[{"text":"To reach as many stations as possible on limited power.","is_correct":true},{"text":"To talk with one station on every continent.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"To find the station that is farthest away.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"To stay awake at the radio for a full day.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$To reach as many stations as possible on limited power.$q$, $q$The second paragraph says the goal is to "make contact with as many other stations as possible, using only power from batteries and a small generator." The distant island contact is a highlight, not the stated goal.$q$, 'draft', 'a6a05ab9-b449-5c56-ae70-4422edf5b9f8')
